{"about_the_game":"<strong>Lust Effect</strong> [18+] is a first-person shooter with adult content. You play as Ashley, a woman who wakes with no memory and finds herself trapped among xenomorphic creatures. As you explore shadowy corridors, you piece together your past - including intimate moments - and interact with characters who may become allies or objects of desire.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/28f42eca5bc89e03a2b1d8c21e19e3a0.poster.avif?t=1760991359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/28f42eca5bc89e03a2b1d8c21e19e3a0.webm?t=1760991359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/28f42eca5bc89e03a2b1d8c21e19e3a0.mp4?t=1760991359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Blending sci-fi and survival horror, Lust Effect challenges you to manage scarce resources - ammo, oxygen, and even social rapport - to survive escalating dangers aboard a hostile station. Every step through its dim hallways uncovers fragments of Ashley\u2019s history and opens new possibilities for connection, temptation, and escape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/b138b3c7c7cda19e5153cb5ff02cbde8.poster.avif?t=1760991359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/b138b3c7c7cda19e5153cb5ff02cbde8.webm?t=1760991359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/b138b3c7c7cda19e5153cb5ff02cbde8.mp4?t=1760991359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Varied station levels</strong>: Explore distinct station sectors, each hiding unique threats and secret paths.<br></li><li><strong>Survival resource</strong>: balance ammo, oxygen, and social rapport to stay alive under pressure.<br></li><li><strong>Tension and temptation</strong>:  a mix of horror, survival, and sensual conversations.<br></li><li><strong>Epic boss fight:</strong> face a set-piece encounter that demands timing, resource discipline, and smart positioning.<br></li><li><strong>Story-driven campaign</strong>: recover Ashley\u2019s memories and unravel what really happened aboard the station.<br><br>Are you ready for a lust-fueled space adventure?</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920170?t=1760991359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920170?t=1760991359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/500f3b27f2c715706d61880fc4a8333f331a19ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760991359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/500f3b27f2c715706d61880fc4a8333f331a19ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760991359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit sexual scenes and nudity. It graphically depicts sexual acts. All characters depicted in sexual situations are 18+."},"detailed_description":"<strong>Lust Effect</strong> [18+] is a first-person shooter with adult content. You play as Ashley, a woman who wakes with no memory and finds herself trapped among xenomorphic creatures. As you explore shadowy corridors, you piece together your past - including intimate moments - and interact with characters who may become allies or objects of desire.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"